        "text": "<p>Fill in the blank to make the sentence present perfect continuous.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\">Word Bank</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\">has been</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\">have been</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\">had been</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\">been</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>My sister  @_@  making traditional casual clothing since she was sixteen years old.</p>"
      },
